<title>INDIA: India's Greaves 1996/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's Greaves 1996/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     416.5  vs    328.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	    7,960.9  vs  7,233.7</p>
<p>    Net profit	     416.5  vs    328.0</p>
<p>    Shr (rupees)	     9.42 vs	7.42</p>
<p>    Div (percent)	   32    vs  no comparison</p>
<p>    Other income	   166.7  vs    146.1</p>
<p>    Total expenditure  7,194.1  vs  6,616.2</p>
<p>    Interest costs	 259.9  vs    260.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   115.3  vs     93.0</p>
<p>    Tax			141.8  vs     82.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Greaves Ltd, India's largest manufacturer of internal combustion engines, said in a statement that it expects its performance in 1997/98 to be better than last year provided it continues to improve operational efficiency and financial management.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
